await test('Report generation creates immutable typed instance and actual report download',async p=>{await nav(p,'reports/templates');await biz(p,'reports/templates','generate','rpttpl2');await bizConfirm(p);await nav(p,'reports/library');const row=p.locator('[data-record-id]').filter({hasText:'威胁事件复盘'});const id=await row.getAttribute('data-record-id');assert(id);await biz(p,'reports/library','inspect',id);await cleanDialog(p);const body=await p.locator('#dialog').innerText();assert(body.includes('威胁事件复盘'));assert(body.includes('证据'));assert(await p.locator('#dialog-title').evaluate(el=>{const r=el.getBoundingClientRect();return r.top>=0&&r.bottom<=innerHeight;}),'Report opens at its title, not scrolled to footer');assert(await p.locator('#dialog [aria-label="关闭弹窗"]').evaluate(el=>{const r=el.getBoundingClientRect();return r.top>=0&&r.bottom<=innerHeight;}),'Report close control remains in viewport');await p.screenshot({path:path.join(OUT,'08-report-preview.png'),fullPage:true});await p.keyboard.press('Escape');const download=p.waitForEvent('download');await biz(p,'reports/library','download',id);const d=await download;assert(d.suggestedFilename().endsWith('.html'));const text=fs.readFileSync(await d.path(),'utf8');assert(text.includes('威胁事件复盘'));assert(text.includes('证据'));assert(!text.includes('beta.example.test'));});
